<![CDATA[ AltId: The default Alternate ID value with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ PatronType: The numeric value associated with Patron Type with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ PatronStatusCode: The code value associated with the Patron Status with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ Addresses: Repeatable address information with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ - Type: The address type with which to populate the patron record during creation; Primary, Secondary, Sponsor, or Care/of<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ - Street: The street address with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ - City: The city with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ - State: The state with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ - PostalCode: The postal code with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ LastActionDate: the last action date with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ PreferredAddress: The address type designated as preferred for patron notifications with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ BirthDate: The date of birth with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ Phone1: The primary phone number with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ Phone2: The secondary phone number with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ PhoneType: The numeric value associated with the phone carrier with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ EmailNotices: The email preference (i.e. send email, do not send email) with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ Email: The email address with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ ExpirationDate: The expiration date with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ LastEditDate: The last edit date with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ LastEditedBy: The staff alias responsible for the most recent patron record edit with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ Language: The language preference with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ RegBranch: The registration branch with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ DefaultBranch: The default branch with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
<![CDATA[ CollectionStatus:  The collection status (i.e. not sent, do not send, sent) with which to populate the patron record during creation<br/> ]]>
</xs:documentation>
</xs:annotation>
